    {
      "game": "Enshrouded",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/14129/450x258/enshrouded-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792666800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/14129-buy-enshrouded-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Giolatos",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/14323809-1682321845.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "Not Recommended\n\nIf you love endless grinding and repetitive gameplay loops, this might be for you, but I personally found it boring. While the base building looks nice, it serves almost no gameplay purpose since enemies never attack or raid your home. The combat is clunky and finicky, and the quest system is incredibly messy—the map just floods you with endless markers and repetitive fetch quests that give zero real sense of progression. It tries to blend elements from Valheim and Elden Ring but ends up feeling shallow compared to both."
    },
